SourceSystemConnector's systemEnumId, and the connector is the parent of its SourceSystemConnectorField rows.
No tenant config here: a tenant's audits, runs, queries and conclusion codes live in its config pack
(drpn-ai/darpan-config-<client>) and move by the admin app's /transfer (DAR-BE-160).
-->
